  "name": "managing-self-driving-spend",
  "description": "Explains and controls what Self-driving (Inbox) costs. Use when the user asks what they spent on Self-driving, which signal sources or scouts drive that spend, how spend changes day to day, how many reports a source or scout produced, or how to lower or cap the spend. Breaks spend down by signal source, scout, and day, links it to the reports it produced, recommends changes ranked by savings, and applies them only after the user confirms each one. Trigger terms: inbox spend, self-driving cost, scout cost, why is my bill high, reduce inbox spend, billing limit, daily report limit, turn off a source, pause a scout, scout pre-check.",
